# The /ops road (issue #105, the Admin and Ops standard):
# the copy's operator surface stands inside the app, at
# Settings, then Admin, and /ops on the app's host exists
# and leads to it. Pages reads this file from the site
# root. The self-host server sends the same redirect from
# its own code; the two are kept alike by hand, the way
# _headers and the server's header list are. The surface
# itself stays gated: the app steps into the Admin page
# only when the people route answers for the caller.
